            "notes": "The key strategy of this deck revolves around ramping up quickly with mana acceleration cards like Exploration, Burgeoning, and Lotus Cobra to cast powerful threats like Primeval Titan and Emrakul, the Promised End. The deck includes a variety of land tutoring spells such as Crop Rotation and Sylvan Scrying to ensure consistency in finding key lands like Maze of Ith or Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth. Additionally, the deck focuses on disrupting opponents' strategies with cards like Song of the Dryads and Glacial Chasm while protecting key pieces with cards like Sylvan Safekeeper. Overall, the deck aims to overwhelm opponents with a high amount of mana resources early in the game and close out the game with massive threats and strong board presence."
